 left=('Why', 'A law is a long meeting. Mixing fields can shorten a meeting both fields already have; it cannot supply one neither has.'),
 right=('Where this shows up', 'The ETH refutation and the Fourier exponent are cheapened laws: real savings, still not polynomial for 3-SAT.'),
