 card=('Set every x = ½', 'x + y + z ≥ 1 with x = y = z = ½: 3/2 ≥ 1 ✓', 'The basic LP relaxation asks for fractional values satisfying each clause. Halves satisfy every clause of every instance. LP plus the affine relaxation accepts every unsatisfiable instance we tested (t80).'),
 left=('Strongly polynomial LP', 'OpenAI\'s Nov 24 paper gives a strongly polynomial LP algorithm (Smale\'s 9th problem). Faster LP still sees ½.'),
